async function fixture(serial:number,status:"pending"|"shipped"|"delivered"|"returned"|"cancelled"="pending") { const raw=convexTest(schema,modules);const ids=await raw.run(async ctx=>{const branchId=await ctx.db.insert("branches",{name:`فرع ${serial}`,address:"القاهرة",isActive:true});await ctx.db.insert("userProfiles",{userId:`admin-${serial}`,tokenIdentifier:`admin-${serial}`,name:"مدير",role:"admin",branchId,permissions:[],isActive:true});const customerId=await ctx.db.insert("customers",{name:"عميل",phone:`011${serial}`,balance:0,totalPurchases:0,branchId,isActive:true});const orderId=await ctx.db.insert("orders",{orderNumber:`ORD-${serial}`,customerId,customerName:"عميل",items:[],total:serial,deposit:0,remaining:serial,status:"ready",branchId});const invoiceId=await ctx.db.insert("invoices",{invoiceNumber:`INV-${serial}`,customerId,customerName:"عميل",items:[],subtotal:serial,discount:0,tax:0,total:serial,netTotal:serial,creditedTotal:0,paid:0,remaining:serial,paymentMethod:"cod",status:"unpaid",branchId,type:"sale"});const deliveryId=await ctx.db.insert("deliveries",{deliveryNumber:`DEL-2026-${String(serial).padStart(5,"0")}`,customerName:`عميل ${serial}`,customerPhone:`010${serial}`,city:"القاهرة",address:"عنوان",items:[{productName:"منتج",quantity:1,unitPrice:serial}],totalAmount:serial,grandTotal:serial,paymentMethod:"cod",codAmount:serial,prepaidAmount:0,shippingCompany:"شركة",shippingCost:0,status,branchId});return{branchId,deliveryId,orderId,invoiceId};});return{raw,t:raw.withIdentity({subject:`admin-${serial}`,tokenIdentifier:`admin-${serial}`}),...ids};}

async function creationFixture(serial:number, options:{orderStatus?:"draft"|"confirmed"|"ready"|"delivered"|"cancelled";missingCustomer?:boolean;invoiceStatus?:"unpaid"|"partial"|"paid"|"cancelled"|"partially_returned"|"fully_returned";orderTotal?:number;deposit?:number}={}) {
  const raw=convexTest(schema,modules);
  const ids=await raw.run(async ctx=>{
    const branchId=await ctx.db.insert("branches",{name:`إنشاء ${serial}`,address:"القاهرة",isActive:true});
    await ctx.db.insert("financeSettings",{isInitialized:true,cutoverDate:"2026-07-01",defaultClearingDelayDays:0,updatedAt:Date.now()});
    await ctx.db.insert("userProfiles",{userId:`creator-${serial}`,tokenIdentifier:`creator-${serial}`,name:"مدير",role:"admin",branchId,permissions:[],isActive:true});
    const customerId=await ctx.db.insert("customers",{name:"عميل موثوق",phone:`010${serial}`,balance:0,totalPurchases:0,branchId,isActive:true});
    if((options.deposit??0)>0)await ctx.db.insert("customerBalances",{key:`${customerId}:${branchId}`,customerId,branchId,receivableBalance:100,advanceBalance:options.deposit??0,totalPurchases:100,openingBalancePostedAt:Date.now(),updatedAt:Date.now()});
    const productId=await ctx.db.insert("products",{name:"منتج",sku:`SKU-${serial}`,costPrice:20,sellPrice:50,stock:10,inventoryValue:200,minStock:0,unit:"قطعة",branchId,isActive:true});
    const linkedCustomer=options.missingCustomer?undefined:customerId;
    const total=options.orderTotal??100,deposit=options.deposit??0;
    const orderItems=[{productName:"منتج",quantity:2,unitPrice:50}];
    const invoiceItems=[{productId,productName:"منتج",quantity:2,unitPrice:50,discount:0,total:100}];
    const orderId=await ctx.db.insert("orders",{orderNumber:`ORD-C-${serial}`,customerId:linkedCustomer,customerName:"عميل موثوق",items:orderItems,total,deposit,remaining:total-deposit,status:options.orderStatus??"ready",branchId});
    const invoiceId=await ctx.db.insert("invoices",{invoiceNumber:`INV-C-${serial}`,customerId:linkedCustomer,customerName:"عميل موثوق",items:invoiceItems,subtotal:100,discount:0,tax:0,total:100,netTotal:100,creditedTotal:0,paid:0,remaining:100,paymentMethod:"cod",status:options.invoiceStatus??"unpaid",branchId,type:"sale"});
    return{branchId,customerId,orderId,invoiceId};
  });
  const t=raw.withIdentity({subject:`creator-${serial}`,tokenIdentifier:`creator-${serial}`});
  const args={orderId:ids.orderId,invoiceId:ids.invoiceId,city:"القاهرة",address:"عنوان موثوق",shippingCompany:"ناقل",expectedCarrierFee:1,branchId:ids.branchId,date:"2026-07-26",requestId:`create-${serial}`};
  return{raw,t,args,...ids};
}
